<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:880px">
  <div class="about-head"><img src="/static/brand/liv-seal-color.svg" alt="" width="120" height="120"><div>
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">About <%= brand %></span>
    <h1><%= brandLong %></h1>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:1.08rem;margin:0"><%= brand %> is a private United States accreditation organization. We review and accredit education partners, and we operate the verification service for the certificates issued on the basis of their completion reports.</p>
  </div></div>
  <h2 class="mt">Our name</h2>
  <div class="grid g3">
    <div class="card"><h3><span class="gold-l">L</span>eading</h3><p class="muted mb0">We set a clear, demanding bar for the training providers we accredit and the credentials they issue.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><span class="gold-l">I</span>nstitute</h3><p class="muted mb0">An organization dedicated to the quality and accountability of workforce training.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3><span class="gold-l">V</span>erification</h3><p class="muted mb0">Every credential is signed, tracked and revocable, and anyone can confirm it in seconds.</p></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mt">Our mission</h2>
  <p>To make every professional training credential instantly verifiable, so qualified people are recognized and unverified claims are caught before they reach the job site.</p>
  <h2 class="mt">What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Review education partners against defined criteria: the qualifications and competence of their trainers, their curricula and their training methods.</li>
    <li>Accredit approved partners and audit them periodically.</li>
    <li>Issue certificates on the basis of the completion reports submitted by accredited partners, with unique IDs and signed QR codes.</li>
    <li>Run a public verification portal with live status, including revocation.</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="alert info small"><%= brand %> accreditation is a private, voluntary program operated by <%= legalEntity %>. <%= brand %> is not a government agency, is not recognized by the U.S. Department of Education or CHEA as an accrediting agency, and does not grant degrees, government licenses or registration with any professional body. Accreditation reflects that a partner met <%= brand %> criteria at the time of review; it does not guarantee the competence or performance of any individual.</div>
  <h2 class="mt">Leadership</h2>
  <div class="grid g3">
    <div class="card"><h3>[Name]</h3><p class="muted mb0">President</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>[Name]</h3><p class="muted mb0">Director of Accreditation</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>[Name]</h3><p class="muted mb0">Chief Technology Officer</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="small muted mt"><%= brand %> and <%= brandLong %> are trade names of <%= legalEntity %>, a limited liability company registered in the United States. [Registered address]</p>
</div></section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
